// EASCape: the Lletya elves (the cache gives Goreu, Ysgawyn, Arvel, Mawrth and Kelyn Pickpocket).
// The OSRS wiki's elf pickpocketing: level 85, 353.3 experience, a 6 second stun (10 ticks) and 5
// damage, success 6/256 at level 1 to 100/256 at 99, and Template:Pickpocket/Elf's loot (coins
// 280-350 105/128, 2 death runes 8/128, 3 nature runes 5/128, a jug of wine 6/128, a fire orb
// 2/128, a diamond 1/128, gold ore 1/128). Lletya is reached only after starting Mourning's End
// Part I, as the wiki says pickpocketing them needs. Ours: "elf's pocket".
[pickpocket_lletya_elf]
table=pickpocket
data=npc,mourning_town_elf_1
data=npc,mourning_town_elf_2
data=npc,mourning_town_elf_3
